      "Put a realist alongside: a coach, a physio or a training partner who has the right to say that the preparation does not match the goal.",
      "Check methods before you believe in them: who researched it, who it worked on, what it is meant to achieve. Your strength is openness, your weakness is credulity.",
      "After every start, compare the picture with the reality: what matched and what did not. This ritual turns the vision into a tool rather than a wish.",
