      "In a team this is the person who can lift the mood and set the ambition, but they must not be left alone with the day-to-day running: they need an organised type alongside them. In an individual sport this is the athlete who gets the most out of themselves when there is a big story, and who fades in a season without a goal. In both cases, give them a goal that sits a little beyond the bounds of the reasonable.",
